# Cloudflare DNS

## Defaults

1. List records for the named zone/name before create to avoid duplicates.
2. Create/update only the record types and names the user specified.
3. TTL / proxied flags: keep existing values unless the user set them.
4. Prefer MCP tools over raw Cloudflare API while MCP works.
